[E0501] Error: cannot `return` from a deferred expression
   ╭─[ err/44_defer_restrictions/main.wip:6:9 ]
   │
 5 │     defer {
   │     ──┬──  
   │       ╰──── inside this `defer`
 6 │         return 1
   │         ────┬───  
   │             ╰───── would leave the function in the middle of its cleanup
   │ 
   │ Note: a `defer` runs while its block exits: it cannot replace the result or skip the cleanup after it
───╯
